WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.459
If you know where to go.

00:00:25.231 --> 00:00:28.193
Ah, Hagrid! The usual, I presume?

00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:32.280
No, thanks, Tom.
I'm on official Hogwarts business.

00:00:32.489 --> 00:00:35.575
Just helping Harry buy
his school supplies.

00:00:35.825 --> 00:00:39.371
Bless my soul. It's Harry Potter!

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:47.087
Welcome back, Mr. Potter.
Welcome back.

00:00:47.337 --> 00:00:51.675
Doris crockford. I can't believe
I'm meeting you at last.

00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:57.389
Harry Potter. Can't tell you
how pleased I am to meet you.

00:00:57.597 --> 00:01:00.100
Hello, professor. I didn't see you.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:05.355
Professor quirrell will be your
defense against the dark arts teacher.

00:01:05.563 --> 00:01:07.941
Oh, nice to meet you.

00:01:08.233 --> 00:01:11.319
Fearfully fascinating subject.

00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:16.116
Not that you need it, eh, Potter?

00:01:17.075 --> 00:01:21.246
Yes, well, must be going now.
Lots to buy.

00:01:21.454 --> 00:01:23.206
Harry: Goodbye.

00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:29.462
- See, Harry? You're famous.
- But why am I famous?

00:01:29.713 --> 00:01:33.133
All those people,
how is it they know who I am?

00:01:33.383 --> 00:01:37.137
I'm not sure I'm the right person
to tell you that.

